        <t:profileDesc xmlns:t="http://www.tei-c.org/ns/1.0">
            <t:creation> Not before <t:date>1563</t:date>, not after <t:date>1597</t:date>.
            </t:creation>
            <t:abstract>
                <t:p>A collection of chants close to the Dǝggwā but not identical with it. The colophon tells that the
                work was compiled by <t:persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS12652Gera">ʾabbā  Gera</t:persName> and <t:persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS12654HablaSellase">ʾabbā
                Habla Śǝllāse</t:persName> from a number of Dǝggʷā witnesses,
              following the order of <t:persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS8550sardaDe">King Śarḍa Dǝngǝl</t:persName>.</t:p>
            </t:abstract>
